TC-API-002: Get a booking with a non-existent ID

Objective: Verify that the API returns an appropriate response when requesting a booking that does not exist.

Preconditions:

The API is accessible.

No booking exists with the requested ID.

Request:

Method: GET

URL: https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com/booking/999999999

Expected Result:

HTTP status code 404 Not Found.

The response does not contain booking data for the requested ID.

Actual Result:

HTTP status code: 404 Not Found.

Status: Passed
